//! Command risk tables from the `COMMAND` replies of the supported
//! servers.
//!
//! Generated, do not edit by hand. Regenerate with
//! `VARVE_WRITE_RISK_TABLES=1 cargo test -p varve-driver-redis --lib --
//! --include-ignored risk_tables_match_the_servers`; without the
//! variable the test fails when the servers disagree with this file.
//! Sources: Redis 6.2.24, Redis 8.10.2, Valkey 9.1.2.
//!
//! Names are lower case, `name` or `name|subcommand`, sorted. A command
//! is read-only only when every server that has it says so; it is
//! dangerous or has subcommands when one of them says so.

